WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Emerald Sprawl is no longer bracing for impact. Now the city is answering back, and every answer redraws who still looks in control.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
We have a developing situation in Rust Market runners. Recovery crews forced a visible closeout push through Rust Bazaar instead of letting debt pressure stay abstract.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Behind the desk, the next move is already visible. Ghostline field GM: Replace rumor spillover with hard dispatch routing before the board loses coherence.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Public trust now moves because someone closed the loop, not because a narrator said so. The city remembers the crews that move first and the districts that fail to recover.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Tonight the city closes on this reality: Rust Bazaar is the hottest visible district at 77 heat. Rust Bazaar moved the hardest this turn with delta 8. Tomorrow the board opens again, and the next faction that hesitates will be seen.
